The '''Brewing Stand''' is a {{Common}} item that is a core part of [[Brewing]], as nothing can be brewed without one. The easiest way to obtain one is to buy one from the [[Alchemist]] for {{c|30}}, or from crafting.

The Brewing Stand functions similarly to vanilla Minecraft and up to three [[Water Bottle]]s/[[Awkward Potion]]s/[[Potions]] can be placed in the bottom three slots and a single brewing ingredient/modifier can be placed in the top slot. It takes 20 seconds for any brewing action to complete. See [[Brewing]] for more information.

'''Note: ''If you are having issues placing Water Bottles in a brewing stand, they are probably [[Tagless Items]]. Throw them on the ground and pick them up to fix the issue.'''''<br><br>

